  "maps": {
    "409": {
      "name": "Route 8",
      "events": {
        "16": {
          "name": "Fusion Count Trainer",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "People call it Infinite\nFusion, but that's\nmarketing. The real number\nis finite. Everything is."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "12": {
          "name": "Combination Trainer",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The number of possible team\ncombinations with fusion\nis staggering. Most people\npick what looks strong and\nstop thinking about it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But there are trainers who\nspend years testing every\npermutation. Looking for\nsomething nobody's\nfound yet."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That's the real question:\nnot how many exist,\nbut which one is yours."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 21,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Show me what you decided on."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {
                "self_switch": "A"
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's not about the\npossibilities. It's about\nthe one you commit to."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "11": {
          "name": "Gambler (Blackjack)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I used to gamble at the\nGame Corner in Celadon.\nNow I play cards out here.\nCleaner air, same odds."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "22": {
          "name": "Gambler 2 (Blackjack)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Roll the dice! ...Okay,\ntechnically it's cards.\nBut the spirit's the same."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "17": {
          "name": "Egg Giver",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "My partner and I breed\nPokemon out here. The route\nbetween cities is good\nfor walking eggs."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "13": {
          "name": "Twin Battle (Anne)",
          "pages": {
